    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process of clearing the riddles is all recorded, so you will be able to create your own music video.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and click only!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/extras/f5acb57d45c18f8519b9c639ef37edc6.avif?t=1745581607\" data-has-big width=800 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus your cursor on suspicious objects and click on it. Once you clear the game, you can play a hidden mode\u2049 An escape room game set in the music video &quot;KOEGASURU&quot; by TEMPLIME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction of Creators</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/extras/c98e712c2d3004b3ff9ddc545b4e28c9.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME</strong> is a music unit consisting of composer <strong>KBSNK</strong> and DJ <strong>tempura</strong>. They began their activities in April 2019 and released their debut track \u201c<strong>Neon Light</strong>,\u201d featuring digital artist <strong>Toto Hoshimiya</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2020, their album <strong>\u201cCloud Diver\u201d</strong> ranked 4th on the <strong>Billboard Japan Download Albums Chart</strong>. Since then, they have been active in various collaborations, including an <strong>official remix for Vaundy</strong>, and providing tracks for artists and projects such as <strong>Tomori Kusunoki</strong>, <strong>Denkoubu</strong>, <strong>Kokonatsu 2.0</strong>, and <strong>ExWHYZ</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In March 2023, their track <strong>\u201cEscapism\u201d</strong> was selected for <strong>Porter Robinson\u2019s</strong> playlist <strong>\u201ccherished music\u201d</strong>, gaining international attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2024, they released <strong>\u201cEMPT MILE\u201d</strong>, their first full-length album as a solo project, continuing to pursue their musical activities with vigor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/extras/0436cd3f368c82df9685b549c45200be.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative circle consisting of Zumochi, in charge of illustration and 3D modeling, and YuKiMuMa, responsible for programming, video production, and product development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Design\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU\u3000TEMPLIME </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Programming\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YuKiMuMa Zumochi SHI maru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Art\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zumochi YuKiMuMa Hiyori Kimura </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Sound\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > KBSNK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process of clearing the riddles is all recorded, so you will be able to create your own music video.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move and click only!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/extras/f5acb57d45c18f8519b9c639ef37edc6.avif?t=1745581607\" data-has-big width=800 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus your cursor on suspicious objects and click on it. Once you clear the game, you can play a hidden mode\u2049 An escape room game set in the music video &quot;KOEGASURU&quot; by TEMPLIME!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction of Creators</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/extras/c98e712c2d3004b3ff9ddc545b4e28c9.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TEMPLIME</strong> is a music unit consisting of composer <strong>KBSNK</strong> and DJ <strong>tempura</strong>. They began their activities in April 2019 and released their debut track \u201c<strong>Neon Light</strong>,\u201d featuring digital artist <strong>Toto Hoshimiya</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2020, their album <strong>\u201cCloud Diver\u201d</strong> ranked 4th on the <strong>Billboard Japan Download Albums Chart</strong>. Since then, they have been active in various collaborations, including an <strong>official remix for Vaundy</strong>, and providing tracks for artists and projects such as <strong>Tomori Kusunoki</strong>, <strong>Denkoubu</strong>, <strong>Kokonatsu 2.0</strong>, and <strong>ExWHYZ</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In March 2023, their track <strong>\u201cEscapism\u201d</strong> was selected for <strong>Porter Robinson\u2019s</strong> playlist <strong>\u201ccherished music\u201d</strong>, gaining international attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2024, they released <strong>\u201cEMPT MILE\u201d</strong>, their first full-length album as a solo project, continuing to pursue their musical activities with vigor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646860/extras/0436cd3f368c82df9685b549c45200be.avif?t=1745581607\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creative circle consisting of Zumochi, in charge of illustration and 3D modeling, and YuKiMuMa, responsible for programming, video production, and product development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Game Design\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MOCHIDAIKOUGAKUBU\u3000TEMPLIME </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Programming\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YuKiMuMa Zumochi SHI maru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Art\u3011  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zumochi YuKiMuMa Hiyori Kimura </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Sound\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > KBSNK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Create your own music video by controlling Hatsune Miku! When you solve the 4 riddles, a music video will be created of you solving the riddles! It is an escape room game set in the music video &quot;KOEGASURU&quot; by TEMPLIME!",
